 384:Drivers/BSP/STM32U5xx_Nucleo/stm32u5xx_nucleo.c **** /**
 385:Drivers/BSP/STM32U5xx_Nucleo/stm32u5xx_nucleo.c ****   * @brief  Configures button GPIO and EXTI Line.
 386:Drivers/BSP/STM32U5xx_Nucleo/stm32u5xx_nucleo.c ****   * @param  Button Button to be configured
 387:Drivers/BSP/STM32U5xx_Nucleo/stm32u5xx_nucleo.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
 388:Drivers/BSP/STM32U5xx_Nucleo/stm32u5xx_nucleo.c ****   *            @arg  BUTTON_USER: Wakeup Push Button
 389:Drivers/BSP/STM32U5xx_Nucleo/stm32u5xx_nucleo.c ****   * @param  ButtonMode Button mode
 390:Drivers/BSP/STM32U5xx_Nucleo/stm32u5xx_nucleo.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
 391:Drivers/BSP/STM32U5xx_Nucleo/stm32u5xx_nucleo.c ****   *            @arg  BUTTON_MODE_GPIO: Button will be used as simple IO
